def orders_in_week(orders: list[tuple[int, str]], week: int) -> list[str]:
    # Helper function to get the working day number from an order reference
    def get_working_day(order_ref: str) -> int:
        # Assume order references are in the format "WeekDay Number"
        # Extract the week day number
        return int(order_ref[1:2])

    # Filter orders based on the week day number
    return [order_ref for order_ref, _ in orders if get_working_day(order_ref) == week]
```

